  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math> subject to constraints <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is",
